  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nordpraktik Russia 1999</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nordpraktik Ryssland 1999</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">During six weeks in the autumn of 1999, 160 young Russian managers will be working at different Swedish companies. The regions in north- western Russia as well as Moscow are priorotized for this programme. The internship in Sweden comprises five weeks at the companies and oneweek of training in management and market economy.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">I sex veckor under h&#xF6;sten 1999 kommer 160 unga ryska f&#xF6;retags- ledare att arbeta p&#xE5; olika svenska f&#xF6;retag. Regionerna i nordv&#xE4;stra Ryssland liksom Moskva prioriteras i detta program. Vistelsen i Sverige utg&#xF6;rs av fem veckor p&#xE5; f&#xF6;retagen och en veckas utbildning i ledarskap och marknadsekonomi.</narrative>
  </description>
